        {
          "body": "[P1] Keep mock-transport timing out of qualifying evidence\n\nThe collector accepts `injected-mocktransport` receipts and derives pacing and zero-retry observations from them exactly as it does for the owned production transport. A caller can supply a no-wait injected pacer with a fake monotonic clock and MockTransport, then pass the resulting source-bound receipts into this collector; the forged timing can meet the frozen gate values without real waits or provider dispatches. Reject mock transport attestations for qualification, or leave these control observations unknown.",
          "commit_id": "e9c0ea7e26ce68b3b58afe12bbaee837b1e46d54",
