        {
          "body": "Fixed in 8837218eb0750674476c2265077915fc997e8f22. Only the owned HTTPX acquisition path can provide qualifying pacing, measured-gap, and zero-retry observations. Injected MockTransport receipts retain unknown values, including with a fake no-wait clock and mocked arXiv redirects. The regressions cover those cases; 32 focused acquisition/resource tests, Ruff, and diff checks passed. No real acquisition or provider calls occurred.",
